  E1 . E2 .  . E1 G2 .  A2 . Bb2 B2  . D2 E2 .

  # Bar 2: Screaming resonant cutoff climb
  E1 . E2 .  . E1 G2 .  A2 . B2 D3   . E3 D3 B2

  # Bar 3: Relentless syncopated drive
  E1 . E2 .  . E1 G2 .  A2 . Bb2 B2  . D2 E2 .

  # Bar 4: Chromatic turnaround with biting screamer filter bite
  G2 . G2 .  Ab2 A2 . Bb2  B2 . D3 .  C3 B2 A1 -
] n>d /SS 2

# Stream 3: Roland Jupiter-8 Sparkling 80s Arpeggio (C Minor, 64 steps)
# Cascading 16ths across Cm -> Ab -> Bb -> Gm with soaring high turnaround
[
  C3 G3 C4 Eb4  G4 Eb4 C4 G3  C3 G3 C4 Eb4  G4 Eb4 C4 G3
  Ab2 Eb3 Ab3 C4  Eb4 C4 Ab3 Eb3  Ab2 Eb3 Ab3 C4  Eb4 C4 Ab3 Eb3
  Bb2 F3 Bb3 D4  F4 D4 Bb3 F3  Bb2 F3 Bb3 D4  F4 D4 Bb3 F3
  G2 D3 G3 Bb3  D4 Bb3 G3 D3  G3 Bb3 D4 G4  D4 Bb3 G3 -
] n>d /SS 3

# Stream 4: Casio CZ-101 Digi-Bass & Reso Brass Stabs (A Minor, 64 steps)
[
